      "sectionKey": "En Ana abriu a porta e entrou na sala",
      "summary": "The example 'Ana abriu a porta e entrou na sala' illustrates coordination of two actions performed by the same subject.",
      "claimType": "general",
      "materiality": "substantial"
    },
    {
      "claimId": "MLS-CLM-D79281D436B040CC313E60DF",
      "sectionKey": "Los grupos verbales pueden coordinarse con conjunciones como e, ou, mas",
      "summary": "Verbal groups can be coordinated using conjunctions such as 'e', 'ou', and 'mas'.",
      "claimType": "general",
      "materiality": "substantial"
    },
    {
      "claimId": "MLS-CLM-E063F1279A30D5C5B5299963",
      "sectionKey": "Los miembros pueden compartir elementos de la oración.",
      "summary": "The members of coordinated verbal syntagms can share elements of the sentence.",
      "claimType": "general",
      "materiality": "substantial"
    },
    {
      "claimId": "MLS-CLM-0412D86DA147BDF5A465FBB4",
      "sectionKey": "También pueden tener complementos distintos",
      "summary": "Coordinated verbal syntagms can also have distinct complements.",
      "claimType": "general",
      "materiality": "substantial"
    },
